message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Rainfall Verification Dashboard"
abstract: >-
  An interactive Streamlit application for verifying gridded deterministic and
  ensemble precipitation forecasts against gridded observations. Provides
  categorical, extremal-dependence, continuous, probabilistic and spatial
  verification scores, ensemble diagnostic plots, per-grid-cell score maps and
  bootstrap confidence intervals, for NetCDF and GRIB2 input.

type: software
